p/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3000:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/2/code.py:346:            extend_repeating_tile_diagonally_until_blocked(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3001:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/2/code.py:358:# --------------- generator (output-first, diagonal + collision-stop) ---------------\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3002:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/2/code.py:394:    raise ValueError(\"direction must be diagonal\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3003:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/2/code.py:431:    \"\"\"Cells for the first `units` diagonal copies, including the seed at k=0.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3004:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/2/code.py:476:    \"\"\"Maximum number of full diagonal copies that fit before touching the frame.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3005:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/2/code.py:508:    \"\"\"Place one plus, one diagonal ray, and one blocker, or return None.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3006:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:15:      - directions are diagonal only, so every legend is the 6x7 diagonal template\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3007:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:18:      - rooms are generated as plain rectangles so the diagonal rebound pattern is visually clean:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3008:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:40:          zigzag endpoint produced by one or more diagonal bounces\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3009:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:45:      - directions: exactly 4 diagonals\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3010:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:57:      Generator preserves that exactly with the original 6x7 diagonal legend template.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3011:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:66:    - diagonal movement assumes corner-cut prevention via both orthogonal support cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3012:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:79:    - the diagonal-only restriction is visible immediately because all legends share the 6x7\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3013:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:80:      diagonal shape and no cardinal legend appears\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3014:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:95:    - because samples all show diagonal legends plus reflected endpoints, a human can infer that\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3015:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:99:    - solver expects legends to decode to diagonal vectors in generated data\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3016:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:416:    Move yellow pixels inside sealed rooms according to corner legends, but only along diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3017:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:424:    - Each legend contains center and indicator marks whose offset encodes one of the four diagonal\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3018:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:429:      legend to get the initial diagonal direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3019:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:432:    - Simulate up to a fixed number of diagonal steps. When the next step hits a wall, flip the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3020:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/47/code.py:438:      \"the far wall.\" You must track a finite diagonal reflection path inside the room.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3021:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:25:#      each usable object is a hollow diagonal funnel whose single spike is a bbox corner.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3022:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:28:#      Example: suppose a NW-pointing cup has 4 interior payload pixels and the diagonal cells\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3023:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:31:#      D1 alone would instead paint diagonal step1..step4 continuously.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3024:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:32:#      This combo erases the interior payload, walks diagonally one step at a time, paints only\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3025:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:37:#      \"advance diagonally\" decides which cell is inspected,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3026:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:41:#    - Only four diagonal directions are used; that keeps the rule legible while still requiring\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3027:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:44:#      so the sample set cannot silently degrade into plain diagonal emission or plain dashed rays.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3028:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:51:#    - Original mouth flooding used one opposite side only. For diagonal funnels that is insufficient;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3029:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:55:#      1. use a diagonal step vector,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3030:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:62:#    - The entire diagonal corridor to the edge is reserved in `occ_path`, including skipped cells,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3031:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:68:#    - From a few examples, the solver sees a corner-spike diagonal funnel, then in the output a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3032:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:78:#      and lies exactly on the continuation of the launched diagonal ray.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3033:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:82:#    - Assumption: the first non-bg cell on the launch diagonal is the stopping obstacle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3034:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:207:    Eject content pixels from diagonal cup-frames outward along a 45-degree tail direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3035:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:210:    - Detect the spike corner of each diagonal funnel.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3036:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:213:    - Traverse diagonally outward cell by cell:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/_logs/13.log:3037:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/44/code.py:296:    Build a diagonal funnel whose spike i